   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Verdict: accuracy and hallucination are both reported as within\nnoise under the pre-registered rule, because the deltas are smaller\nthan the 2.08pp run-to-run spread, even though the permutation test\nmakes chance an unlikely explanation. Cost is the only regression\nthat clears the bar.",
   "originalText": "Verdict: accuracy and hallucination are both reported as within\nnoise under the pre-registered rule, because the deltas are smaller\nthan the 2.08pp run-to-run spread, even though the permutation test\nmakes chance an unlikely explanation. Cost is the only regression\nthat clears the bar.",
